  "content": "\n\n<h5><span><span>专为模组&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scape-and-run-parasites\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Scape and Run: Parasites</a></span></span></h5>\n<hr>\n<h5><span><span><strong>特色：</strong><br>- 所有实体、GUI界面、粒子效果和方块均已重新绘制，分辨率提升至 32x<br></span></span></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5><strong><span><span>v1.5 更新日志 </span></span></strong><span><span>（感谢 </span></span><span><span><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/elegant_raman55/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AlphaCeph </strong></a>协助处理错误报告）</span></span></h5>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><span><span>v1.5 更新日志</span></span></strong></p>\n<p>- 修复了来自最新模组更新的缺失纹理。<br>-&nbsp;物品、盔甲和武器的纹理已重新绘制，现在在 32 分辨率下呈现更清晰美观的效果。</p>\n<p>-&nbsp;对粒子效果和特效进行了原版风格的重制工作。</p>\n<p>-&nbsp;<span><span>修正了额外怪物变体以匹配原版变体。</span></span> <span><span>部分纹理降低了对比度。</span></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5><span><span><br><strong>v1.4 更新日志</strong></span></span></h5>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h5><span><span><strong>v1.4 更新日志</strong><br></span></span></h5>\n<p>-&nbsp;对所有物品和效果进行重新绘制与放大升级<br>-&nbsp;提升了武器和盔甲的外观质量。品质提升至 32x<br>-&nbsp;更改了部分方块的特效<br>-&nbsp;降低了部分怪物纹理的亮度与饱和度</p>\n<p>-&nbsp;修复了 Buglin 和 Rupter 的纹理<br>-&nbsp;<span><span>新增了一个测试用方块随机生成器。</span></span> <span><span>目前仅适用于受感染的泥土</span></span><br>-&nbsp;为怪物喷出的肉块添加了重制纹理<br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/yRzkzJB/2023-05-25-17-25-05.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"305\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<span><span><br><strong>v1.3 更新日志</strong><br></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h5><span><span><strong>v1.3 更新日志</strong><br></span></span></h5>\n<p>-&nbsp;适配该模组的最新版本</p>\n<p>-&nbsp;重新绘制了所有方块及大部分怪物</p>\n<p>-&nbsp;预览版纹理包暂不包含随机纹理，将在下次更新中随重制的粒子效果一同添加。</p>\n<h5><strong><span><span>注：抱歉让大家等了这么久。我近期个人生活遇到了一些问题。</span></span></strong></h5>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<span><span><br><strong>v1.2 更新日志<br></strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><span><strong>v1.2 更新日志</strong><br>- 新增生物纹理：Primitive Devourer（原始吞噬者）、Crux、Heed、Assimilated Ender Dragon（同化末影龙）<strong><br></strong>- 重绘生物纹理：Adapted Longarms、Heavy Carrier、Flying Carrier、Sheep、Assimilated Big Spider（同化大蜘蛛）<strong><br></strong>- 新增 GUI 增益/减益图标<strong><br></strong>- 为新植物 \"Ringlet\" 添加纹理<strong><br></strong>- 修复方块 \"Flesh Stairs\"（血肉台阶）的纹理<br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wgr5f2J/SRPImg-11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/vxKjCxT/SRPImg-12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zRkZ6Vn/SRPImg-13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GVWFjNS/SRPImg-14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qm5yHHc/SRPImg-15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mBRYd81/SRPImg-16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\"></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span><span><br><strong>v1.1 更新日志</strong><br></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>v1.1 更新日志<br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LJWtns3/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/NY3VSqz/2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/2NDDx4D/3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/R9Fc77h/4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bHzNkF2/5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PZVV1p5/6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<span><span><br></span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:left\"><span><span>本资源包可与任何自定义 Minecraft 整合包或资源包兼容，不会破坏原版包或其他模组的完整性。您可以随意使用，我将密切关注该模组的更新并持续维护此资源包。<br><br><strong>截图&nbsp;&darr;</strong><br></span></span></h5>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h5><span><span><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ryv4KhF/1-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\"></span></span><span><span><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mhtF46H/2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\"></span></span><span><span><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pfYWqgj/3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\"></span></span><span><span><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/YpDnRG7/5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\"></span></span><span><span><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/HKbjxfg/4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\"></span></span></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<span><span><br></span></span></p>",
